So I'm an gnomish archaeologist, I'm doing fairly well.  I played the
protection racket and got 4 points of AC.  I found gauntlets of power
on Dlvl1 and a cloak of displacement and bag of holding shortly
thereafter.  I hadn't even been to Sokoban yet.  This should have been
an omen ...

So I'm at Mine's End.  I've found THREE luckstones.  I'm doing well.
And then I run into a disenchanter.  And no, it's not a chameleon.  I
just barely kill it (it wasn't the disenchanting attacks that were
dangerous, it was its damage!).  Then I run into a peaceful baby gray
dragon.  Then a hostile orange dragon.  And a gray dragon.  And a
jabberwock.  I FINALLY found the damn polytrap and was turned into a
scorpion.  Then the orange dragon put me to sleep and killed me.
Arrrghhh.  Sometimes, there's just really nothing you can do.


